          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umugabo wiwe mu gatondo aravyuka, yugurura urugi rw’inzu, arasohoka agira ngw agende. Asanga uwo mugore wiwe arambaraye imbere y’umuryango w’inzu, ibiganza vyiwe biri mu rwinjiriro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
